=== I. FINRA 2267: written BrokerCheck information once every calendar year ===
2267(a): Except as otherwise provided in this Rule, each member shall once every
  calendar year provide in writing (which may be electronic) to each customer the
  following items of information:
  (1) FINRA BrokerCheck Hotline Number;
  (2) FINRA Web site address; and
  (3) A statement as to the availability to the customer of an investor brochure
  that includes information describing FINRA BrokerCheck
